# Example of the PRIVATE forbidden-terms file. Copy to ~/.config/rag-harness/forbidden-terms.local (outside the repo) and fill with the REAL terms.
# One term per line, case-insensitive substring match. Typical categories (put the real values, never here):
#   - client / product / platform names and their abbreviations
#   - client and platform domains (even partial)
#   - names of people involved
#   - your employer's and the client's internal project names
#   - client-specific vocabulary found in the question set or in the answers
acme-corp
acme-portal.example
jane-doe
